---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
---

<Layout title="Arc | Find your next right step">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[var(--canvas)] text-[var(--ink)]">
    <Header />
    <section class="hero-grid mx-auto max-w-[1280px] gap-12 px-6 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.02fr_0.98fr] lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> A front door to financial professionals</p>
        <h1 class="display-title mt-6 max-w-3xl">You do not need to know who to call. <span class="text-[#477941]">Just tell us what is happening.</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl">Arc explains which professionals may help, in what order, and what to ask next.</p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><a href="/onboarding" class="button-primary focus-ring">Start with your situation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="#how-it-works" class="button-secondary focus-ring">See how it works</a></div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-[var(--quiet)]">A guided demo using fictional people and providers. No advice, accounts, or payments.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center"><div class="story-card w-full max-w-[550px]">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] pb-5"><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Start with what is going on</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--quiet)]">No financial terminology required</p></div><div class="avatar avatar-lime" aria-hidden="true">A</div></div>
        <div class="space-y-4 py-6"><div class="bubble bubble-arc">Tell me what is changing in your financial life and I’ll help map the next questions.</div><div class="bubble bubble-alex">I have started my first proper job, saved about $35,000, and might buy an investment property.</div><div class="bubble bubble-arc">We can start by clarifying your goals, then connect the questions to the right professionals.</div></div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--pale)] p-5"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--quiet)]">A pathway, not a verdict</p><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="mini-step"><span>01</span><strong>Financial adviser</strong><small>Clarify the bigger plan</small></div><div class="mini-step"><span>02</span><strong>Mortgage broker</strong><small>Test borrowing questions</small></div><div class="mini-step"><span>03</span><strong>Tax accountant</strong><small>Know what to track</small></div><div class="mini-step"><span>04</span><strong>Conveyancer</strong><small>Understand a contract</small></div></div></div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="border-y border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--forest)] text-white"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1280px] gap-5 px-6 py-7 text-sm sm:grid-cols-3 lg:px-10"><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white/45">01</span><span>Describe your life event normally</span></div><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white/45">02</span><span>See who may help and why</span></div><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white/45">03</span><span>Choose a useful next conversation</span></div></div></section>
    <section id="how-it-works" class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="eyebrow">How Arc helps</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4">A calm route through a complicated moment.</h2></div><div class="mt-14 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--line)] md:grid-cols-3"><article class="bg-[var(--raised)] p-7 lg:p-9"><span class="step-number">01</span><h3 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold">Listen first</h3><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">Answer a few plain-language prompts. Review or edit what Arc has captured.</p></article><article class="bg-[var(--raised)] p-7 lg:p-9"><span class="step-number">02</span><h3 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold">Explain the order</h3><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">See which roles may help, what each can answer, and what can wait.</p></article><article class="bg-[var(--raised)] p-7 lg:p-9"><span class="step-number">03</span><h3 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold">Make a next move</h3><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">Compare fictional demo profiles and decide what context you want to share.</p></article></div></section>
    <section id="scenarios" class="bg-[var(--pale)]"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1280px] gap-12 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:px-10 lg:py-24"><div><p class="eyebrow">Life events Arc can map</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4">Start with the moment, not the job title.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-md leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">Arc helps you get oriented. Licensed professionals provide the advice that follows.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><a href="/onboarding" class="event-link focus-ring"><span>01</span><strong>Starting a first well-paid job</strong><small>Build a plan for new income</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/onboarding" class="event-link focus-ring"><span>02</span><strong>Thinking about buying property</strong><small>Understand the questions and order</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/onboarding" class="event-link focus-ring"><span>03</span><strong>Changing family or dependants</strong><small>Find the right conversations</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/onboarding" class="event-link focus-ring"><span>04</span><strong>Making sense of a new debt</strong><small>See who may help you assess it</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-24"><div class="rounded-3xl bg-[var(--forest)] px-7 py-12 text-white sm:px-12 lg:flex lg:items-end lg:justify-between lg:gap-12"><div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--pale)]">Ready when you are</p><h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl font-serif text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-5xl">Bring the situation. Arc will help with the starting point.</h2></div><a href="/onboarding" class="button-primary mt-8 shrink-0 focus-ring lg:mt-0">Tell Arc what is happening <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <footer class="border-t border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--canvas)]"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1280px] flex-col justify-between gap-5 px-6 py-10 text-sm text-[var(--muted)] sm:flex-row lg:px-10"><div><p class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">arc</p><p class="mt-2 max-w-lg text-xs leading-5">Arc guides you to questions and professional roles. It does not provide financial, credit, tax, legal, or investment advice.</p></div><p>© 2026 Arc · Fictional demo</p></div></footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
